te points from the `object_to_delete_from` rather than faces.\n\n<span style=\"color:#E69963\">***volume_mode***</span>\n<br />Solid mode voxelizes the mesh with a solid interior. Shell mode voxelizes the mesh as a thickened surface with a hollow interior.\n\n<span style=\"color:#82D99F\">***volume_resolution***</span>\n<br />The resolution of the interior volume.  Smaller numbers will cull \"tighter\" to the culling object.\n\n<span style=\"color:#82D99F\">***offset_volume***</span>\n<br />Erode/Expand the interior volume.\n\n<span style=\"color:#CCB699\">***adjust_culling***</span>\n<br />An fCurve that controls the erode/expand of the internal volume.\n\n***\n## Output\n<span style=\"color:#90A3F4\">***culled_object***</span>\n<br />The resulting object.\n\n<span style=\"color:#82D99F\">***scatter_weights***</span>\n<br />Scatter weights array containing 0 (no poins) and 1 (all points).","ports":[{"name":"culled_object","direction":"output","type":null},{"name":"scatter_weights","direction":"output","type":null},{"name":"object_to_delete_from","direction":"input","type":"Object"},{"name":"culling_object","direction":"input","type":"Object"},{"name":"volume_resolution","direction":"input","type":"float","default":"0.0500000007f"},{"name":"volume_mode","direction":"input","type":"Geometry::Converters::VolumeMode","default":"Solid"},{"name":"offset_volume","direction":"input","type":"float","default":"0f"},{"name":"points","direction":"input","type":"bool","default":"true"},{"name":"adjust_culling","direction":"input","type":"Math::FCurve","default":{"version":"1","preExtrapolation":"0","postExtrapolation":"0","points":[{"point":{"locked":"1","interpolation":"1","pcn":{"xp":"-0.10000000000000001","yp":"0","x":"0","y":"0","xn":"0.10000000000000001","yn":"0"}}},{"point":{"locked":"1","interpolation":"1","pcn":{"xp":"0.90000000000000002","yp":"1","x":"1","y":"1","xn":"1.1000000000000001","yn":"1"}}}]}}],"terminal_states":[],"counts":{"nodes":33,"connections":62,"values